+//! The game's names for its monsters, by the id the game gives each kind (`em_id`: the number in `emNNN.arc`, which is also the
+//! index in the game's own `Monster` text table), in English and in Spanish. An empty name is an id the game gives no name.
+
+const NAMES: [(&str, &str); 86] = [
+    ("", ""),
+    ("Rathian", "Rathian"),
+    ("Rathalos", "Rathalos"),
+    ("Qurupeco", "Qurupeco"),
